{"id":"u-80522ac2-179b-4bb7-9724-62b90b46bd7f","src":"community","title":"Gotaame on a mission","author":"Neeraj G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TQV1HO-gotaame-on-a-mission","desc":"This is an 8-week hybrid training plan combining strength, bag work, and running. It is designed to build functional fitness progressively — starting at controlled intensity and building week by week in weight, rounds, and power output. Each session has a clear purpose: Push days develop pressing and shoulder strength, Pull days build the back and biceps, Leg and Core days lay the athletic foundation, and Friday's full-body session closes the week with volume and bag conditioning. Monday runs keep the cardiovascular base alive without burning out the body. The bag work is always done after weights — never before — so technique stays sharp and effort is intentional. This plan is for people who want to get stronger, move better, and hit harder, without burning out or cutting corners.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Bodyweight Fitness","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-08T08:07:09.616Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push A","Monday Run","Pull A","Legs + Core","Push B + Pull B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Landmine Press","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Punching Bag","sets":[{"sec":180,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Run","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{